===Etymology===
{{compound|en|sun|screen}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# A cream, to be spread on the skin, containing [[organic compound|organic compounds]] that [[absorb]], and/or [[titanium dioxide]] that [[reflect|reflects]] the sun’s [[ultraviolet]] [[radiation]].

